# Session 11: 1812, one player, the French, Tactical off. The computer plays the Allies,
# first at aggression PASSIVE, then RECKLESS (docs\won-source-study.md, section 3.2).
seed 1
pace 1

wait 4
key space
wait 4
key s
wait 2
key down down down down
wait 1
shot start-year
key enter
wait 3
shot objective
key space
wait 1
# Utility: swap to the French. Item 1 is now FRENCH, so "a" reaches Aggress, which steps
# to the next level each time: from the shipped 3 (NORMAL) to 4, 5 and 0 (PASSIVE).
key u a
wait 1
shot french
key a
wait 1
key a
wait 1
key a
wait 1
shot passive
key t esc
wait 1
shot main-menu

# Each turn: end it, wait for the computer's moves, then Esc to close the messages.
# Esc also answers a retreat menu (the game then chooses the retreat itself) and matches
# no item of the main menu.
repeat 2
key e y
wait 30
shot turn-end
repeat 16
key esc
wait 2
end
shot next-turn
end

# Aggress five more times: 1 to 5 (RECKLESS).
key u
wait 1
repeat 5
key a
wait 1
end
shot reckless
key esc
wait 1

repeat 2
key e y
wait 30
shot turn-end
repeat 16
key esc
wait 2
end
shot next-turn
end
